							2159.148
						],
						"pointId": 7469
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 711140401,
					"content": "...These adjustments ought to do it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140402,
					"content": "Ah, have you placed the instruments already? Thank you so much.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140403,
					"content": "Once I'm done placing this one, I'll give you your reward.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140404,
					"content": "You could have just given it to me alongside the rest of the batch.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140405
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711140405,
					"content": "Thank you for your kindness. Unfortunately, this instrument is somewhat special. It requires some additional adjustments and calibrating, and I wouldn't want to trouble you that much.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140406,
					"content": "Let's go to that cliff over there and place it, then I'll give you your reward.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140407,
					"content": "That sounds really hard... Have you always worked like this?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140408,
					"content": "Haha, at least now, I only need to place my instruments down on the ground. In a previous expedition, I actually had to figure out a way to place one in the middle of a raging river...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140409,
					"content": "Couldn't you just take a boat over there?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140410
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711140410,
					"content": "I mean, if all I needed to do was to drop the instrument, then sure, I could have just taken a boat, dropped it in the middle of the river, and left...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140411,
					"content": "But I was trying to measure the intensity of the water flow, so I had to keep that specialized instrument stationary within the heart of the stream so that it would neither float to the top nor sink to the bottom...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140412,
					"content": "Thankfully, there was a drawbridge above that river. Had there not been a bridge, I'd have had to ask some people to help me draw a rope between the two mountains...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140413,
					"content": "And then hang the device onto one of the ropes, before using another rope to move it to the center of the river and drop it in the water.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140414,
					"content": "Anyway... There's no point talking about that now. It's not like that's something we'll have to deal with... That said, we'll still pass by a drawbridge on our way to our destination.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140415,
					"content": "Come this way. That drawbridge isn't far from here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				}
			]
		},
