			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 711149940,
					"content": "After chasing away the Treasure Hoarders, you bring the people they cornered to a nearby pavilion to catch their breath.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 711140801,
					"content": "Thank you, I really don't know how to express my gratitude...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140802,
					"content": "You are... Ms. Qiu?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140803
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711140803,
					"content": "#Ah... It's you, {NICKNAME}! Well, fancy running into you again! This is really... This is the second time that you've done me such a huge favor!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140804,
					"content": "Weren't you guys in Fontaine learning how to shoot a film? How are you already back in Liyue?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140805,
					"content": "Have you already mastered the art of filmmaking?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140806
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711140806,
					"content": "Well, rather than that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yifeng"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140807,
					"content": "It'd probably be more accurate to say we've been forced to make some quick Mora first.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xingye"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140808,
					"content": "You two...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140809,
					"content": "Mr. Geisert is indeed a master filmmaker, and he's given us a lot of very useful advice. However...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yifeng"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140810,
					"content": "The films that he's helped us shoot have all really focused on big ideas and themes. As for the actual plot, or the world and things that were intended to be featured...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xingye"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140811,
					"content": "They kind of... In Mr. Geisert's words, they were \"left behind the scenes.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yifeng"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140812,
					"content": "But we had looked into filmmaking in the first place to create a film that could bring attention to Chenyu Vale's excellent teas. If we had stayed with Mr. Geisert, we would have gone nowhere. So...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xingye"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140813,
					"content": "So! I made the executive decision to put a pause on our studies and come back to shoot a documentary. We will use this opportunity to put our knowledge to the test!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140814,
					"content": "...Well, and because we'd just about run out of funds.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yifeng"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140815,
					"content": "H—Hey, haven't I told you about my plan already? As long as this documentary becomes a smash hit, we'll make our investment back in no time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140816,
					"content": "#Well, and then we found ourselves cornered by Treasure Hoarders on a drawbridge. Thankfully, the great {NICKNAME} came to save us.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140817,
						711140818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yifeng"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140817,
					"content": "Isn't this place... a bit far from Qiaoying Village?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140819
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711140818,
					"content": "But why are you here if you want to photograph Qiaoying Village?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140819
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711140819,
					"content": "*sigh* Well, I wanted to get some majestic shots of the scenery, so the film would look a bit more imposing...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140820,
					"content": "But we got a bit too distracted while shooting and caught the attention of those Treasure Hoarders. We fled all the way here but were still cornered by them in the end...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140821,
					"content": "Wait, so the \"pro photographers\" Woliu mentioned earlier were...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140822,
					"content": "Yep, they were Ms. Qiu and her assistants.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140823,
					"content": "Wh—Where did you suddenly just pop up from, Ms. Woliu? I—I swear I didn't see you at all before now...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140824
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140824,
					"content": "I just hid myself very well.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140825
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140825,
					"content": "So you already know each other...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140826
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711140826,
					"content": "I mean, Ms. Woliu is an expert hydrologist. No one knows these lands better than her.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140827
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140827,
					"content": "We'd consulted her several times before this on the best places to shoot.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140828
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140828,
					"content": "We've even tried to get her to join us! But she said that she could only consider once she's finished with her work.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140829
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140829,
					"content": "Boss, um... While we were running away earlier, we seemed to have, um, left the case containing our film and equipment on the ground...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140830
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yifeng"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140830,
					"content": "I think... All the work that we've done so far is in that case...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140831
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xingye"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140831,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140832
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140832,
					"content": "#Ms. Woliu! {NICKNAME}! Paimon! Thank you for everything! Wh—When you are next free, please find me in Qiaoying Village!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140833
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140833,
					"content": "After all... You've saved our lives, so we've got to prepare a reward in return!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140834
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140834,
					"content": "But for now, we must be off and away! Hurry! Where did we leave that box!? We need to go back for it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140835
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140835,
					"content": "Ms. Qiu and her assistants leave in a great hurry...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140836
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711140836,
					"content": "That film case... sure has gone through a lot...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140837
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140837,
					"content": "They say that good things often come at the end of many tribulations. I'm sure Ms. Qiu's film will turn out to be a hit.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140838
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140838,
					"content": "Anyway, let me give you your reward. I'll go place my final instrument shortly, and then... probably go check on Ms. Qiu to see how she's doing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140839
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140839,
					"content": "I've got to find her fast, or she'll probably be off archon-knows-where again, shooting her film.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140840
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140840,
					"content": "Hmm, I suppose she did just say that she can be found at Qiaoying Village. I'll just go check that out later.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Woliu"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7111409,
